``` Maghreb Threat Watch hunt | generated 2026-11-10 | 8 domains ```
``` Needs DNS data mapped to the CIM Network_Resolution data model. ```
| tstats summariesonly=false count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen
    from datamodel=Network_Resolution
    where DNS.query IN ("wifakepay.com", "*.wifakepay.com", "cannabissamenbank.ch", "*.cannabissamenbank.ch", "atbclientsupport.com", "*.atbclientsupport.com", "6x8147.xyz", "*.6x8147.xyz", "biat-bonuss.sbs", "*.biat-bonuss.sbs", "81472.my", "*.81472.my", "attijariwafabank.com.eg", "*.attijariwafabank.com.eg", "biat-quiltexpo.com", "*.biat-quiltexpo.com")
    by DNS.src DNS.query
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
| sort - count
